71
00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:15.900
What is an ECU?

72
00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:18.900
It's part of a car that has a processing unit,

73
00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:21.900
different I.O. outputs, different networking going on,

74
00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:23.900
and it's in charge of controlling the vehicle

75
00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:26.900
and communicating with other parts of the car

76
00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:31.900
